  "subtitle": "Capture asset tag, charger, protective case, and software access; confirm existing damage and return condition.",
  "description": "Device Checkout records asset tag, charger, protective case, software access, existing damage, and return condition. Device Checkout evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this device checkout time-ordered tracking when staff must document asset tag and charger. Reconcile protective case, software access, existing damage, and return condition before the device checkout handoff. Use the inventory record, barcode or serial scan, accessory count, condition images, acceptable-use receipt, repair ticket, return scan, and damage disposition. Ask the assigned device checkout reviewer to confirm asset tag against the organization's policy.",
